<script setup lang="ts">import {computed,onMounted} from 'vue';import {datasets} from '../stores/datasets';import {runs} from '../stores/runs';import PageHeading from '../components/common/PageHeading.vue';import PhaseTable from '../components/PhaseTable.vue';import TailBars from '../components/TailBars.vue';import {minutes} from '../utils/format';onMounted(()=>Promise.all([datasets.load(),runs.load()]));const result=computed(()=>runs.items.value.find(r=>r.status==='completed')?.result)</script><template><PageHeading eyebrow="NETWORK NOTEBOOK / 总览" title="从平均数，走向每一程。" note="先识别观测质量，再比较阶段分位与尾延迟。所有结果由Python计算，样本仅为模拟。"/><div class="overview-split"><section><div class="section-heading"><h2>四站履约剖面</h2><router-link to="/results">展开运行结果 ↗</router-link></div><div v-if="result" class="metrics"><div><small>完整配送</small><strong>{{result.valid_count}}</strong><span>票 / 同一观测口径</span></div><div><small>总时延 P95</small><strong>{{Number(result.total_quantiles.p95).toFixed(0)}}</strong><span>分钟 / 经验分位</span></div><div><small>质量隔离</small><strong>{{result.rejected_count}}</strong><span>票 / 保留原因</span></div></div><PhaseTable v-if="result" :rows="result.phases"/><p class="footnote">P95不是各阶段P95之和；阶段表与总时延分别计算。</p></section><aside class="field-note"><p class="eyebrow">TODAY'S REVIEW</p><h2>长尾来自哪里？</h2><TailBars v-if="result" :rows="result.tail.contributions"/><p>将每个阶段收敛到其中位数，比较重采样总时延尾部变化。此处不作因果归责。</p></aside></div><section class="workflow-strip"><div><b>01</b><h3>统一里程碑</h3><p>保留时区、重复与缺失；先核查，再计算。</p></div><div><b>02</b><h3>固定研究口径</h3><p>线路组、尾部分位、重采样次数与seed一起留档。</p></div><div><b>03</b><h3>复核后归档</h3><p>分析师提出行动，管理员批准，下载不可变快照。</p></div></section></template>
